  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Constructing coiling thread caves requires a Gu formation, rank six immortal material dark soft silk, and rank seven immortal material regret water rocks. Fang Yuan names both materials among what he must gather once he has funds for a large expansion of that resource.",
      "chapters": [
        1316
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coiling-thread-caves",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By Dong Fang tribe’s method, coiling thread caves need a Gu formation plus dark soft silk and regret water rock so ordinary spiders can transform into regretful spiders. Fang Yuan gathers dark soft silk and regret water rocks, paying a large amount of immortal essence stones and other immortal materials for them, before he attempts the Gu formation itself.",
      "chapters": [
        1327
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dong-fang-method",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_dong_fang_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Working from the same coiling thread cave formation, the one that needs dark soft silk and regret water rock together,",
      "chapters": [
        1327
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eightfold-modification-fails",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan has Chi Shang attempt a modification meant to multiply the regretful spider yield eightfold, but the deduction proves unsolvable and the plan is abandoned.",
      "chapters": [
        1330
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eightfold-modification-fails",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chi_shang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Regret water rock is named among a large stock of earth path immortal materials packed into an immortal aperture when preparing for tribulation.",
      "chapters": [
        2133
      ],
